(***       Standard job list for an M:N configuration       ***)
(Copy this file into the directory Templates/Manufacturer or   )
(Templates/User and change the name into _TEMPL_, e.g.         )
(_TEMPL_.JOB or, if it is to exist in several languages, into  )
(_TEMPL__<language>, e.g. _TEMPL__GR.JOB.                      )
(Adapt this job list to your individual requirements.          )
(**************************************************************)
(A job list is executed with transfer direction MMC -> NC if   )
(the job list itself or a workpiece with a job list is loaded  )
((softkey Load) or selected (softkey Select). Unloading of a   )
(job list or workpiece with a job list causes execution with   )
(transfer direction NC -> MMC.                                 )
(                                                              )
(Copy instructions COPY:                                       )
(-----------------------                                       )
(Transfer direction MMC->NC: The files are copied, i.e. they   )
(are now existing on MMC and NC.                               )
(Transfer direction NC->MMC: The files on NC are deleted if    )
(they have not been changed since the copy process; if they are)
(different, the system prompts you with which file you want to )
(work in the future.                                           )
(Command: COPY <source> [<target>]                             )
(Source: name | /path/name                                     )
(Target: * | NC=NCname | CG=Channelgroup | CH=Channelname      )
(          NCname, Channelgroup, Channelname from NETNAMES.INI )
(COPY *                                                        )
( => copies all files from the workpiece of the job list       )
(    into the NC of the current connection                     )
(COPY *.MPF *                                                  )
( => copies all MPFs from the workpiece of the job list        )
(    into all NCs which are configured in the NETNAMES.INI     )
(COPY PART12.MPF NC=NCU_2                                      )
( => copies a file from the workpiece of the job list into     )
(    NC NCU_2                                                  )
(COPY /SPF.DIR/PART12.* CG=MILL2                               )
( => copies all files with a name from a directory e.g PART1.* )
(    from subprograms (SPF.DIR) into a channel group, i.e. into)
(    into all NCs to which channels of this group have been    )
(    assigned, the parameter CG is only possible if a channel  )
(    menu has been configured                                  )
(COPY /MPF.DIR/* CH=CHANNEL22                                  )
( => copies all files from a directory, e.g. all files from    )
(    part programs (MPF.DIR) into the NC to which this channel )
(    has been assigned. Channel names are only assigned unambi-)
(    guously via all NCs if a channel menu has been configured )
(Selection instruction SELECT:                                 )
(-----------------------                                       )
(The SELECT instruction is executed only with selection of the )
(workpiece or job list. The selected program must have been    )
(loaded before into the NC by means of COPY into the           )
(corresponding NC. Exception: Execution from hard disk.        )
(                                                              )
(Command: SELECT name CH=<channel name>  [DISK]                )
( or:    SELECT name CH=<NCname>,<channel no.> [DISK]          )
(name: Name of the part program which is to be selected for    )
(      execution in a specific channel in the NC               )
(Channel name: Channel name from NETNAMES.INI                  )
(NCname:    NCU name from NETNAMES.INI                         )
(DISK (optional) : Execution from hard disk                    )
(SELECT PART12 CH=CHANNEL22                                    )
(SELECT PART12 CH=NCU_2,2                                      )
( => PART2 is selected in the 2nd channel of the NCU_2         )
